Godot 4 pixel city builder in game/ (250x250 tile grid, 32x32 pixel tiles).

Current focus: Timber Economy v1.0 — see SUPPLY_CHAIN.md for build order. Implement ONE tier/task per PR only.

Logistics: goods sit in building input/output storage. Hauler Stations employ haulers who roam the map and auto-haul ready goods to valid destinations (no manual routes in v1).

How to run: open game/project.godot in Godot 4.3+, press F5.

When you finish a task:
- Keep changes small (one SUPPLY_CHAIN task at a time)
- Open a Pull Request on GitHub
- Include screenshot of the running game
- Note which SUPPLY_CHAIN task number you completed

Do not rewrite the whole project unless asked. Do not add siege/combat until wood Tier 2 is done.
